          "rule_title": "AAA Services must be configured in accordance with the security configuration settings based on DoW security configuration or implementation guidance, including STIGs, NSA configuration guides, CTOs, and DTMs.",
          "fix_text": "Configure the network device to be configured in accordance with the security configuration settings based on DoW security configuration or implementation guidance, including STIGs, NSA configuration guides, CTOs, and DTMs.",
          "weight": "10.0",
          "check_content": "Determine if AAA Services are configured in accordance with the security configuration settings based on DoW security configuration or implementation guidance, including STIGs, NSA configuration guides, CTOs, and DTMs.\n\nIf AAA Services are not configured in accordance with the designated security configuration settings, this is a finding.",
          "check_content_ref": {
